WEBVTT

01:32.440 --> 01:33.720
Ta Xue!

01:39.920 --> 01:42.320
Speak. How many troops are ahead of us?

01:48.760 --> 01:49.800
Speak!

01:50.960 --> 01:54.280
The main road to Yizhou is blocked,
with archers stationed everywhere.

01:54.800 --> 01:55.880
There is no way to escape.

02:03.280 --> 02:04.360
- Release the arrow!
- Release the arrow.

02:05.800 --> 02:07.440
ALL ANIMALS SHOWN SERVE STORY NEEDS ONLY
NO HARM CAME TO THEM DURING FILMING

02:15.560 --> 02:17.360
Quick! Release the arrow now!

02:52.320 --> 02:59.200
BRIDAL PROCESSION

03:34.880 --> 03:35.560
ALL ANIMALS SHOWN SERVE STORY NEEDS ONLY
NO HARM CAME TO THEM DURING FILMING

04:02.800 --> 04:09.520
ALL ANIMALS SHOWN SERVE STORY NEEDS ONLY
NO HARM CAME TO THEM DURING FILMING

04:19.360 --> 04:20.200
Ta Xue…

04:23.960 --> 04:24.880
Ta Xue…

04:38.400 --> 04:39.760
ALL ANIMALS SHOWN SERVE STORY NEEDS ONLY
NO HARM CAME TO THEM DURING FILMING

05:09.240 --> 05:11.480
Those who stand in my way…

05:12.560 --> 05:13.760
shall perish!

06:59.840 --> 07:04.800
THE YANG RESIDENCE

08:06.240 --> 08:08.800
Alongside with Ms. Ji,
we have come to pay our respects to you,

08:08.880 --> 08:10.120
Father and Mother.

08:12.080 --> 08:13.200
Wait!

08:40.600 --> 08:43.640
Jinglan! You…
How did you end up injured like this?

08:45.280 --> 08:47.200
What happened to you?

08:48.680 --> 08:50.400
What happened?

09:05.920 --> 09:06.880
I am back.

09:11.760 --> 09:12.680
What are you doing?

09:13.800 --> 09:17.440
Jinglan, today is your brother's wedding.

09:20.480 --> 09:22.360
Wedding?

09:24.880 --> 09:27.520
Don't you think it looks like

09:27.600 --> 09:28.440
you are all taking advantage
of the situation?

09:28.520 --> 09:29.760
What are you talking about?

09:31.640 --> 09:35.440
Taking advantage of Mrs. Ji's misfortune,

09:35.520 --> 09:38.640
you lot press Ms. Ji into
your household as a concubine.

09:40.120 --> 09:42.240
Look at what you have done.

09:43.960 --> 09:46.320
Have you lot

09:46.840 --> 09:48.720
no sense of shame?

09:48.800 --> 09:49.880
- I…!
- Jinglan!

09:53.240 --> 09:56.320
Do not speak nonsense
on your brother's wedding.

09:57.520 --> 10:00.200
Get yourself treated now. Once…

10:01.200 --> 10:02.240
How dare you!

10:02.320 --> 10:04.080
- Father, are you okay?
- Wedding?

10:06.520 --> 10:09.880
Without my permission,
no one can marry her!

10:09.960 --> 10:11.080
I…!

10:11.160 --> 10:14.400
Yang Jinglan!
Who I marry is none of your business.

10:14.480 --> 10:16.200
Who do you think you are?

10:17.240 --> 10:19.440
Yingying, we shall leave now.

10:21.400 --> 10:22.880
- Jinglan!
- Where are you going?

10:26.480 --> 10:29.960
I dare any one of you to try to stop me.

10:31.240 --> 10:33.160
What are you doing?

10:33.920 --> 10:35.080
Jinglan!

10:35.720 --> 10:37.600
You may disregard our family's honor,

10:37.680 --> 10:40.720
but have you thought about Ms. Ji's?

11:03.400 --> 11:04.720
You can take her with you,

11:05.640 --> 11:06.960
but think carefully.

11:08.440 --> 11:10.280
Once she steps out of this door,

11:11.520 --> 11:15.480
her reputation will be in tatters.

12:12.120 --> 12:13.360
Yang Jinglan,

12:14.920 --> 12:16.280
I chose to marry him of my own accord.

12:18.720 --> 12:20.640
Though my wedding with your brother

12:21.160 --> 12:23.560
is a private affair,

12:24.920 --> 12:26.800
the whole Yang family is aware of it.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.520
If word spreads,

12:30.200 --> 12:33.200
both my reputation and your family's honor
will be on the line.

12:34.960 --> 12:35.920
Besides,

12:36.600 --> 12:40.720
your family agreed to this marriage
to save my mother.

12:41.680 --> 12:42.880
If I go back on this promise,

12:44.600 --> 12:46.640
how could I ever hope to earn
anyone's trust in the future?

12:48.920 --> 12:50.280
You do not need to worry about me.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.880
I will silence

12:56.040 --> 12:57.480
whoever dares to breathe a word of it!

13:01.800 --> 13:03.080
Can you silence

13:04.480 --> 13:06.800
the whole world?

13:08.520 --> 13:10.560
Secrets always find their way out,

13:11.440 --> 13:13.200
and rumors can be merciless.

13:13.800 --> 13:15.920
If you truly care about Ms. Ji,

13:17.120 --> 13:21.320
you ought to protect her dignity
and reputation.

13:33.800 --> 13:34.960
Okay.

13:37.640 --> 13:39.200
Since you have chosen

13:40.720 --> 13:42.200
to step into the lion's den,

13:44.880 --> 13:48.360
why not marry someone else?

13:49.400 --> 13:50.320
What?

13:51.840 --> 13:53.080
Where is the sense of morality in this?

13:54.400 --> 13:55.480
How could he speak of such a thing?

13:56.120 --> 13:57.280
This is unacceptable. Absolutely not!

14:01.400 --> 14:02.680
What do you mean by that?

14:03.360 --> 14:04.840
Marry me.

14:06.840 --> 14:08.440
Will you be willing to do it?

14:13.640 --> 14:16.240
But this is none of your concern.
There's no need for you to get involved.

14:16.320 --> 14:18.080
Just tell me. Are you willing to do it?

14:19.400 --> 14:21.320
Yang Jinglan, you have crossed the line!

14:21.920 --> 14:23.240
If you go through with this,

14:23.320 --> 14:24.520
how am I supposed to show
my face to others?

14:25.120 --> 14:29.600
Jinglan!
Ms. Ji is your brother's concubine!

14:29.680 --> 14:31.720
How dare you force her
into marriage like this?

14:31.800 --> 14:34.360
Have you given any thought to the disgrace
it will bring if word spreads?

14:34.440 --> 14:36.080
The ceremony is not finished.

14:37.280 --> 14:39.120
She is not bound to my brother yet!

14:41.120 --> 14:43.720
You lot used her family
to threaten her into this marriage.

14:45.440 --> 14:48.240
If anyone's doing the forcing,
it's all of you!

14:48.320 --> 14:49.800
You are full of nonsense!

14:51.200 --> 14:53.880
She was the one who came to us.

14:54.680 --> 14:55.960
If Mother had not persuaded me
to marry her,

14:56.040 --> 14:57.240
do you think I would have wanted this?

14:57.320 --> 15:01.520
You see her as a pawn,
but to me, she is a treasure.

15:02.120 --> 15:03.360
Today,

15:03.440 --> 15:06.760
I, Yang Jinglan, will marry her!

15:07.480 --> 15:08.400
This…

15:10.720 --> 15:12.440
Isn't this going against all principles?

15:33.520 --> 15:34.760
Okay, that is enough.

15:35.880 --> 15:39.280
We are all family.
There is no need to cause conflict.

15:40.480 --> 15:42.240
Jinglan is simply

15:43.200 --> 15:46.240
concerned that we might
take advantage of Ms. Ji's property

15:46.840 --> 15:48.440
and that making her Jinglin's concubine

15:49.360 --> 15:50.880
would be unfair to her.

15:51.480 --> 15:54.160
That is why
he wants to take her as his wife.

15:54.240 --> 15:55.360
This way,

15:56.040 --> 15:58.760
we can protect both Ms. Ji's reputation

15:58.840 --> 16:01.480
and our family's honor.

16:04.160 --> 16:08.080
Since Jinglin does not want to marry her,

16:13.400 --> 16:14.920
let's make it possible
for Jinglan instead.

16:25.120 --> 16:26.200
Marry me.

16:32.000 --> 16:33.360
Will you be willing to?

16:39.160 --> 16:40.400
I do.

16:43.960 --> 16:45.120
Okay…

16:54.440 --> 16:56.040
I will marry you.

17:01.600 --> 17:03.880
- Jinglan!
- Yang Jinglan!

17:03.960 --> 17:06.000
- Is the doctor here?
- Yang Jinglan!

17:20.760 --> 17:24.040
HUANHUA DYEHOUSE

17:48.320 --> 17:50.560
- Let's talk outside.
- Okay.

17:55.800 --> 17:57.600
Sir, how is my mother?

17:58.560 --> 18:02.200
Mrs. Ji's illness is due
to excessive worry and stress.

18:02.960 --> 18:06.760
After taking the medicine I prescribed,
she will feel much better.

18:08.880 --> 18:10.040
Thank you, sir.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.440
Mr. Zhao, what a surprise to see you here.

18:16.520 --> 18:20.040
I heard the county magistrate
had Mrs. Ji released from prison

18:20.680 --> 18:23.080
and even called
a physician to check on her.

18:23.160 --> 18:25.680
I came to see how she is doing.
How is she?

18:25.760 --> 18:26.840
Well…

18:27.640 --> 18:28.480
the thing is,

18:29.000 --> 18:32.640
a couple of days ago,
Mrs. Yang visited with a physician,

18:32.720 --> 18:35.080
and I could not turn them away
out of respect for the family.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.680
Why did the Yang family
get involved in this?

18:37.760 --> 18:38.960
Do you not know about it, Mr. Zhao?

18:39.480 --> 18:42.760
Ms. Ji will be marrying
Mr. Yang Jinglin as his concubine.

18:42.840 --> 18:45.000
She will soon be part of the Yang family.

18:45.920 --> 18:46.960
Mr. Zhao.

18:47.680 --> 18:48.520
Mr. Yang Jinglan has returned.

18:48.600 --> 18:50.040
He has announced
his wish to marry Ji Yingying.

18:51.800 --> 18:53.000
Yang Jinglan?

19:33.160 --> 19:34.360
It has been so long
since we last saw each other,

19:36.400 --> 19:38.000
you should spare me a smile instead.

19:51.720 --> 19:56.520
If Gao Fang hadn't arrived
with his troops in time,

19:57.560 --> 19:59.160
I would have died on the way here.

20:03.480 --> 20:05.280
Why did you rush back?

20:07.200 --> 20:08.840
You were seriously injured. You almost…

20:08.920 --> 20:10.560
I need to come back to cover for you.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.160
I am merely getting married.

20:24.560 --> 20:26.400
I can take care of myself.

20:27.080 --> 20:28.880
I do not need you…

20:29.760 --> 20:31.880
I can save my mother on my own.

20:34.520 --> 20:35.520
Yes, I know.

20:38.160 --> 20:42.000
You are an amazing woman, Ms. Ji.

20:44.480 --> 20:47.600
Strong and unstoppable.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.520
You can

20:50.800 --> 20:52.520
take care of yourself
perfectly fine without me.

20:54.280 --> 20:55.880
But me?

20:57.200 --> 21:00.520
Without you, I…

21:06.960 --> 21:08.880
would not even have someone
to pour me water.

21:41.640 --> 21:43.600
I have already owe you so much.

21:45.000 --> 21:47.120
I do not know how I will ever repay you.

21:50.760 --> 21:51.640
Repay me?

22:00.800 --> 22:05.160
Helping each other is what allies
are supposed to do.

22:06.480 --> 22:08.240
There is no need to talk about repayment.

22:15.320 --> 22:17.760
Mr. Yang, we do not have enough time

22:17.840 --> 22:20.080
to prepare wedding attire for you two.

22:20.600 --> 22:26.000
Do you and Ms. Ji mind
wearing your parents' wedding attire?

22:26.680 --> 22:27.760
I do not mind using them.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.040
But…

22:33.920 --> 22:34.960
I will take care of her outfit.

22:35.760 --> 22:36.720
Okay.

22:46.480 --> 22:49.520
If you marry my brother,
you will be trapped here forever.

22:52.440 --> 22:54.040
But if you marry me,

22:55.600 --> 22:56.880
you will still have a way out.

22:58.800 --> 23:02.400
After you have repaid
my family's kindness,

23:03.960 --> 23:06.200
I will hand you the divorce papers

23:07.680 --> 23:09.400
so you can leave freely.

23:13.240 --> 23:16.360
Let’s treat this as a partnership.

23:17.560 --> 23:18.640
No debts, no obligations.

23:31.400 --> 23:32.400
Okay.

23:34.440 --> 23:36.120
As long as my mother can be saved.

24:11.360 --> 24:12.280
Can…

24:13.120 --> 24:15.040
you bring over my bundle, please?

24:20.360 --> 24:21.240
Okay.

24:49.560 --> 24:51.040
Shu Red wedding attire.

24:57.240 --> 25:00.040
I found a Red Shu brocade robe.
It must be a reward from the palace!

25:00.920 --> 25:04.000
That is mine! Father gave it to me!

25:04.080 --> 25:05.720
- Let go!
- Give me that!

25:05.800 --> 25:07.160
- Yingying! Let go!
- Let go now!

25:07.240 --> 25:09.200
- Yingying, let go!
- Yingying!

25:14.920 --> 25:16.920
Is this my father's Red Shu brocade?

25:23.520 --> 25:25.160
Where did you find it?

25:25.880 --> 25:27.160
At Prince Bai's residence in Nanzhao.

25:28.360 --> 25:29.800
There are plenty of old tribute brocades

25:29.880 --> 25:32.160
to be found there as well.

25:32.760 --> 25:35.160
Nanzhao? Prince Bai?

25:40.160 --> 25:42.440
So, the person Niu Jin
is colluding with is Prince Bai?

25:44.040 --> 25:47.080
We will talk about this in the future.

25:47.600 --> 25:49.200
It is not something we can deal with now.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.520
At least,

25:53.840 --> 25:55.200
the Red Shu wedding attire

25:57.440 --> 25:58.920
has returned to its rightful owner.

26:25.520 --> 26:29.320
Dear all, today marks the joyous occasion

26:29.960 --> 26:32.840
of Mr. Yang Jinglan’s marriage

26:32.920 --> 26:35.000
to Ms. Ji
from the Sandaoyan Huanhua Dyehouse!

26:35.080 --> 26:39.880
If you have the time,
do come and celebrate with us!

26:40.800 --> 26:41.920
Wasn't it Mr. Yang Jinglin
who was supposed to take

26:42.000 --> 26:43.680
Ms. Ji as a concubine?

26:43.760 --> 26:46.000
How has it become
Mr. Yang Jinglan's marriage now?

26:46.080 --> 26:48.120
Maybe Ms. Ji

26:48.200 --> 26:49.760
is already pregnant
with Mr. Yang Jinglan's child.

26:50.520 --> 26:52.720
Talking behind someone's back
shows a lack of integrity.

26:55.080 --> 26:57.120
Yingxi Dyehouse of Bloom Society

26:57.200 --> 26:59.160
is here to congratulate Ms. Ji
on her wedding!

26:59.240 --> 27:00.920
Sir, please come in!

27:02.120 --> 27:04.160
Cailuan Dyehouse of Bloom Society

27:04.240 --> 27:05.920
is here to congratulate Ms. Ji
on her wedding!

27:06.000 --> 27:08.320
Liuyue Dyehouse of Bloom Society

27:08.400 --> 27:10.760
is here to congratulate Ms. Ji
on her wedding!

27:10.840 --> 27:13.160
- Sir, please come in!
- Luoxia Dyehouse of Bloom Society

27:13.240 --> 27:15.320
is here to congratulate Ms. Ji
on her wedding!

27:15.400 --> 27:16.440
Miss, please!

27:16.520 --> 27:21.120
I, Sang Shisi, the Imperial Uncle
and honorary president of Bloom Society,

27:21.200 --> 27:22.920
am here to congratulate Ms. Ji
on her wedding!

27:23.560 --> 27:26.000
- Sir, please come in!
- Please. Head inside.

27:33.640 --> 27:35.440
I heard Mr. Yang is seriously injured.

27:35.520 --> 27:36.920
Will he be able to go through
with the wedding ceremony?

27:37.760 --> 27:39.040
A serious injury means nothing.

27:39.120 --> 27:41.280
In fact, even if he is barely holding on,
he will go through with the ceremony.

27:57.800 --> 27:59.880
It is my youngest son's wedding today.

27:59.960 --> 28:02.320
May I know the purpose
of your visit, Deputy General Niu?

28:02.400 --> 28:04.600
Yang Jinglan, the brocade officer,

28:04.680 --> 28:07.040
has slaughtered
the city's soldiers for no reason.

28:07.120 --> 28:09.080
His actions were outrageous!

28:09.160 --> 28:11.320
Under General Niu's orders,

28:11.400 --> 28:13.040
I have come to arrest him!

28:13.720 --> 28:14.560
- That is impossible.
- Ha! Look at him.

28:14.640 --> 28:15.520
- Absolutely impossible!
- I told you,

28:15.600 --> 28:16.880
that idiot has always been arrogant,

28:16.960 --> 28:18.760
and sooner or later,
he will bring harm to our family.

28:19.280 --> 28:20.120
- Stop talking already.
- Father!

28:20.200 --> 28:21.400
Father! Father!

28:21.480 --> 28:24.680
Deputy General Niu, how inconsiderate!

28:31.800 --> 28:35.280
It is my wedding today.

28:36.440 --> 28:39.520
And yet you didn't even bring
a gift to congratulate me?

28:40.840 --> 28:44.040
Yang Jinglan, surrender yourself now!

28:44.120 --> 28:45.920
Let’s avoid hurting the innocents!

28:53.280 --> 28:55.760
Do you recognize what this is?

28:55.840 --> 28:57.240
The crown prince's fish tally?

28:58.080 --> 29:00.080
The fish tally
represents the crown prince himself.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.760
- So, kneel!
- The crown prince's fish tally!

29:02.840 --> 29:03.880
Kneel now!

29:05.960 --> 29:08.120
You are just a low-ranking official.

29:08.760 --> 29:11.320
How am I supposed to trust you

29:12.080 --> 29:14.200
when you pull out
the fish tally out of nowhere?

29:14.280 --> 29:17.440
The brocade industry of Yizhou
is of paramount importance,

29:17.960 --> 29:19.720
yet plagued by villainous scheming.

29:20.600 --> 29:22.760
Yang Jinglan, acting
under the crown prince's orders,

29:23.600 --> 29:25.120
has been overseeing
Yizhou's brocade industry

29:25.200 --> 29:28.720
as the brocade officer,
achieving remarkable results.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.400
He is promoted

29:31.440 --> 29:32.800
to supervising commissioner,

29:33.640 --> 29:35.520
granted full authority
to investigate in secret,

29:35.600 --> 29:37.680
execute justice on the spot,
and report afterward!

29:43.560 --> 29:46.000
Qianniu Guards are here
under the Crown Prince's orders

29:46.080 --> 29:47.880
to safeguard Commissioner Yang.

29:53.960 --> 29:55.240
You saw the Crown Prince's
fish tally and failed to kneel.

29:55.320 --> 29:56.680
Do you intend rebellion?

30:06.360 --> 30:08.520
Today is my wedding day.

30:10.840 --> 30:12.200
Yet you barge in with soldiers,

30:13.120 --> 30:16.440
frightening my wife
and disturbing my guests.

30:17.360 --> 30:18.520
What punishment
should befit such insolence?

30:18.600 --> 30:20.240
I was rash.

30:21.160 --> 30:23.240
I apologize for disturbing
the honored guests

30:23.320 --> 30:24.880
and Mrs. Yang.

30:25.720 --> 30:27.040
I kindly ask for your understanding,
Commissioner Yang.

30:34.840 --> 30:35.800
Get lost!

30:39.400 --> 30:40.400
We will leave now!

30:43.960 --> 30:46.320
- That was satisfying!
- Well done!

30:46.400 --> 30:47.440
Get lost!

31:08.760 --> 31:11.520
- Let's have a look at that fish tally.
- Careful now.

31:11.600 --> 31:13.160
It seems we will need
to address you differently from now on.

31:13.240 --> 31:14.480
No more calling you the brocade officer.

31:14.560 --> 31:16.360
From today onward,
it is Commissioner Yang.

31:16.440 --> 31:18.760
- Commissioner Yang!
- Enough…!

31:18.840 --> 31:19.800
Let me help you back to rest.

31:20.400 --> 31:22.000
That will not do.
We have not completed the ceremony yet.

31:22.080 --> 31:24.440
Exactly. He is still fine.
It must be done.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.520
Complete it…? Look at you!

31:26.600 --> 31:29.040
You are injured. Let's postpone it!

31:29.120 --> 31:30.160
No postponing.

31:30.960 --> 31:31.880
It must be done today.

31:32.560 --> 31:34.720
You are barely standing.

31:34.800 --> 31:36.040
Stop the ceremony. Let's go.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.360
No more?

31:38.680 --> 31:39.880
Then, straight to the bridal chamber?

31:41.200 --> 31:42.920
- What nonsense are you all spouting?
- I…

31:43.000 --> 31:44.440
That is right!
Straight to the bridal chamber!

31:46.720 --> 31:48.520
What are you waiting for?
Straight to the bridal chamber! Let's go!

31:48.600 --> 31:49.720
To the bridal chamber! Let's go…!

31:49.800 --> 31:50.720
Let's go! To the bridal chamber!

31:50.800 --> 31:52.040
We do not have to use the sedan chair!

31:52.800 --> 31:55.040
- Let's go!
- Take it slow…!

31:57.320 --> 31:58.640
- Everyone!
- Take it slow.

31:58.720 --> 31:59.640
Enjoy the feast!

32:01.240 --> 32:02.280
Come here!

32:27.760 --> 32:29.120
What is this?

32:29.840 --> 32:31.760
I am staying here tonight.

32:31.840 --> 32:33.120
You are injured,

32:33.200 --> 32:34.880
and I need to check
your bandages through the night.

32:34.960 --> 32:36.440
I cannot be too far.

32:37.600 --> 32:38.480
Let's do this.

32:38.560 --> 32:40.080
You sleep on the bed.
I will sleep on the floor.

32:40.160 --> 32:41.920
What nonsense are you talking about?

32:42.000 --> 32:44.000
I take the bed
and the patient sleeps on the floor?

32:44.080 --> 32:45.240
Absolutely not.

32:55.160 --> 32:57.280
They have prepared
all these festive treats.

32:57.360 --> 32:58.520
It meant to symbolize early…

32:58.600 --> 32:59.640
I know.

33:03.480 --> 33:05.120
But why so many?

33:09.920 --> 33:11.680
I will move them to the side.

33:11.760 --> 33:13.760
I do not want them
pressing on your wounds.

33:14.360 --> 33:15.360
Okay.

33:31.840 --> 33:33.080
Let me grab a pillow.

33:39.240 --> 33:40.560
Did I touch your wound?

33:43.680 --> 33:44.520
It is fine.

34:13.400 --> 34:15.520
All done. Lie down.

34:54.120 --> 34:56.000
You embarrassed Niu Jin today.

34:56.920 --> 34:59.240
Do you think he will
retaliate even harder?

35:03.440 --> 35:05.240
Now that he knows my true identity,

35:05.320 --> 35:08.760
he will understand that
it is futile to target me directly.

35:10.760 --> 35:12.120
What matters most

35:12.200 --> 35:14.120
is how Chang'an
and the military commissioner handle him.

35:15.000 --> 35:18.160
For now, he will not act recklessly.

35:20.200 --> 35:21.200
Rest assured.

35:39.840 --> 35:40.960
Get some rest.

35:52.320 --> 35:55.560
No matter what, thank you for coming back.

35:56.920 --> 35:58.320
It is comforting.

36:51.320 --> 36:52.920
Instead of drowning yourself in wine,

36:53.000 --> 36:55.840
why not think about what to do next?

36:56.440 --> 36:57.800
What else can I do?

36:59.960 --> 37:02.760
She is someone else's wife now.

37:05.600 --> 37:06.720
I have lost.

37:08.560 --> 37:09.680
Lost completely.

37:12.920 --> 37:14.840
Even if she is married,

37:15.800 --> 37:17.560
you can still take her back.

37:18.440 --> 37:19.920
Bring her to your side.

37:22.200 --> 37:26.000
Are you saying this for me,

37:26.080 --> 37:27.480
or are you speaking for yourself?

37:39.920 --> 37:41.320
What is that supposed to mean?

37:43.160 --> 37:45.160
You want Ji Yingying too, don't you?

37:55.840 --> 37:57.800
Mr. Zhao, you misunderstand me.

37:57.880 --> 38:01.120
I am just a businessman, nothing more.

38:04.400 --> 38:05.760
When she was trapped in the fire,

38:05.840 --> 38:08.720
you risked everything to save her.

38:08.800 --> 38:12.680
That did not look like the actions
of an ordinary businessman.

38:13.200 --> 38:16.560
I saved her
because I know you care about her.

38:17.440 --> 38:19.400
If Ji Yingying had died in that fire,

38:19.480 --> 38:21.600
we would not have been able
to work together,

38:22.120 --> 38:23.800
and I would have no way
to achieve my own goals.

38:26.000 --> 38:28.800
Our plan has already fallen apart.

38:29.800 --> 38:30.960
What else could you possibly want?

38:33.120 --> 38:36.880
The brocade industry of Yizhou.
That goal has never changed.

38:37.760 --> 38:40.560
But what about you, Mr. Zhao?
Have you changed?

38:41.480 --> 38:44.760
Have you moved on? Can you give up on her?

39:06.200 --> 39:07.320
Do not test me.

39:08.960 --> 39:10.040
I cannot give up on her.

39:14.000 --> 39:15.680
Then, take her back.

39:17.120 --> 39:19.240
But the first thing we need to do

39:20.640 --> 39:24.000
is to destroy Ji Yingying's relationship
with the Yang family.

39:26.240 --> 39:29.480
You win Ji Yingying,
and I will take the Yang family.

39:36.880 --> 39:37.920
But what will you use to do it?

39:41.360 --> 39:42.320
This wine?

39:43.400 --> 39:44.560
Or these women?

39:47.520 --> 39:49.040
I can still wait

39:49.560 --> 39:53.280
for my father-in-law to kill Yang Jinglan
and reap the rewards without effort.

39:53.360 --> 39:54.440
But what about you?

39:58.640 --> 39:59.840
If you wish to collaborate,

40:00.880 --> 40:02.800
what is your offer?

40:15.560 --> 40:20.120
Sir, Mr. Zhao despises me.

40:20.200 --> 40:24.680
Sir, you must stand up for me!

40:52.720 --> 40:55.760
Master, this is Yizhou.

41:00.720 --> 41:01.760
Everyone, leave.

41:29.880 --> 41:30.760
Go.

41:31.840 --> 41:34.400
- Investigate the Yang family thoroughly.
- Yes, sir!

41:45.280 --> 41:46.640
As long as the rot starts from within,

41:49.080 --> 41:51.040
even the mightiest tree

41:53.160 --> 41:54.760
will eventually fall.

42:11.680 --> 42:13.440
To hold your hand

42:15.040 --> 42:16.600
And grow old together

42:18.320 --> 42:20.080
You said you would marry me.

42:23.080 --> 42:24.320
But now,

42:27.520 --> 42:29.120
you have gone back on your word.

42:33.160 --> 42:36.280
I know you were forced.

42:38.000 --> 42:39.960
The Yang family forced you.

42:41.280 --> 42:44.640
Bai Sheng forced you.
Yang Jinglan forced you!
